@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = replace-with-admin-access-token

### Shared catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One account type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account-types/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/account-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "RRSP_TD" }

### Rename (replace version with the value from GET)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/account-types/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "TFSA_L_RBC_NEW", "version": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001" }

### Delete unused type (replace ID/version with values from GET)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/account-types/1?version=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Missing resource
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account-types/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restore allocation atomically (destructive; use only a test database)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/allocation/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cash": [{ "description": "Opening", "amount": 100, "addedAt": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z" }],
  "options": []
}
